WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.650
We're halfway through the seventh round of the WBC World Middleweight Title Match!

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:10.150
Both fighters are wounded and spilling blood everywhere in this epic back-and-forth!

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.400
We are definitely seeing a death match in the making!

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.530
<i>Don't flinch!</i>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.240
<i>Do that and he'll get you!</i>

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:25.670
<i>I can't believe he hasn't lost his speed yet!</i>

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:29.670
<i>Shit-for-brains... How long are you gonna keep up this slugfest?!</i>

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.960
<i>All night if I have to!</i>

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:35.220
<i>I ain't stopping till I massacre you!</i>

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.350
<i>I am...</i>

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:36.970
<i>{overlap}I'm...</i>

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:37.550
<i>...going to win!</i>

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.850
<i>{overlap }...gonna win!</i>

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:45.910
Neither will back down,
and neither will quit!

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:57.620
<i>They've both run out of stratagems; it's now a test of endurance.</i>

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:02.510
<i>Seeing which one can tough it out and hit harder is boxing at its most basic.</i>

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:05.170
<i>This is definitely a monumental fight.</i>

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:06.560
<i>But...</i>

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:10.080
How can Eagle be having such a tough time?

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.920
But this is his best bout yet.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.730
I'm actually moved.

00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:18.070
<i>I hope this match will be decided with their fists.</i>

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.380
Whoa! What's going on?!

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:29.000
Doctor!

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.010
He's calling for the ringside physician!

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:31.720
Is he joking?

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:33.540
It was just getting good!

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:39.370
They've lost a lot of blood, unfortunately.

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:41.110
So a doctor stoppage?

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:44.720
<i>Takamura-san?</i>

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:52.600
If we get a doctor stoppage, the match will be decided by the points earned in the previous rounds.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:58.150
So will injuries and a judge's decision pour cold water on this heated battle?

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:03.570
Ah! The doctor is shaking his head!

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:05.280
So this is it?

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.580
What's done is done.

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:12.090
This ain't nothing special.

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:14.870
Look at it, it's nothing but a scratch.

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:19.670
You're kidding? It's about to hit the connective tissue!

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:22.170
Don't be so damn limpwristed!

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:25.430
I don't even care if he takes my entire eyeball.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:28.020
We're fighting for the belt.

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:30.430
We're fighting with our lives!

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.520
But...

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:37.000
This is not gonna get us any type of closure!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.770
I'm gonna fight!

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:46.280
I'm fighting!

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.790
Referee! Let's continue!

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.500
They're both raring to go!

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.500
{overlap}Let ‘em fight!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:54.790
Keep going!

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:07.510
Keep going! Keep going! Keep going! Keep going!{ad infinitum}

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:01.280
Both boxers are raising their fists egging on the crowd!

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:04.120
The whole arena's loudly chanting, “Keep going!”

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.970
<i>You probably want closure too, don't you?</i>

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.770
<i>The only thing stopping this fight...</i>

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.250
<i>Is my...</i>

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.810
<i>Will be my...</i>

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:16.810
Box!

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:18.520
<i>...own fists!</i>

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:22.900
And that bell ends the seventh round!

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:25.320
Both of their corners are in a tizzy!

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.820
I don't want a doctor stoppage.

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:30.150
Do something about this!

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.280
You got it.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:32.870
We're cutting it.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.500
I'm making an incision along the corner of your eye.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.630
It'll make most of the blood flow in that direction...

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:41.250
if you start bleeding again.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.360
You may very well start bleeding again,

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:48.260
but this way you'll be able to keep both eyes open.

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.760
Thanks.

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.890
<i>This is a deep wound.</i>

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:59.100
<i>Even if I plug it up with this salve, it'll just open up and gush blood everywhere.</i>

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:04.630
<i>If this takes another hit, the connective tissue will tear apart, and he'll lose his eyelid!</i>

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:07.550
Old man...

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:12.020
Nobody is going to stop me!

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.740
I want to settle it with these!

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.490
<i>You got it.</i>

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:19.720
<i>However...</i>

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.700
No go? You can't stop the bleeding?

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.650
Don't make that face!

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:39.600
This old man swears upon his life that he'll stop the bleeding!

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.880
Shinoda-kun! Get more salve!

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.750
Yagi-chan, wipe off the blood!

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:44.320
Got it!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:50.270
You swear... upon your life?

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:57.500
You only got a few years left, don't waste ‘em.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:02.000
You gotta live... to see the good stuff in store.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.380
<i>The bleeding stopped.</i>

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:07.630
Just you wait! I'll get that belt!

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:16.140
<i>I heard that extreme agitation produces extra adrenaline, which can stop blood loss.</i>

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:18.320
<i>Is it his obsession with the belt?</i>

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:20.630
<i>No, he was obsessed way before this.</i>

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:24.650
<i>What was Takamura-kun's body reacting to?</i>

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:26.760
Takamura!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.390
I'm not going to be waiting for long.

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.990
I'm an old man, you know.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:39.000
The bell kicks off the eighth round!

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.790
<i>Just you wait, old man!</i>

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:44.630
A clean one-two hit!

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:46.210
He can't get away from that left hand!

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:49.380
The champion is ever accurate and on-point!

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.260
<i>The old man said he's not gonna wait for long.</i>

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:53.840
<i>You better give me that belt now!</i>

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:00.930
That's good! Way to stick to the basics!

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:05.550
Damn, his right eye's gotten swollen.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:08.940
If his left eye starts bleeding again...

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:16.070
He takes a right!

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:21.410
His upper grazes the champion's cheek!

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:24.370
The champ's losing balance! Did it get him?!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:28.380
It's not just that! All the hits he's taken tonight are hitting home!

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:30.380
Get him! This is your chance!

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:35.120
He's going for it! The challenger is targeting his hits!

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.180
The champion doggedly guards!

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:40.310
<i>He's not sticking to the basics.</i>

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:42.270
<i>He's clinging to his best punches.</i>

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:44.770
<i>That's how hurt he is!</i>

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:47.110
The challenger is starting to overwhelm him!

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:50.230
<i>Don't you know when to quit?! Hurry up and go down!</i>

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.450
Oh! Now it's the challenger whose knees are buckling!

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:00.370
Don't let him recover!

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.410
They both punch!

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:12.300
Both fighters are bleeding again!

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:17.140
<i>You won't give up even after taking all my hits?</i>

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:20.600
<i>Damn! I'm getting blood in my left eye again!</i>

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:23.520
<i>Huh? I lost sight of him?</i>

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:27.520
<i>Wait, it's both my eyes?!</i>

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:33.320
The challenger's against the ropes!

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:37.570
<i>H-He's strong... He's one tough S.O.B.</i>

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:41.100
<i>I can barely make out the glint in his eyes.</i>

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:44.100
<i>I have to watch out for guys with those eyes.</i>

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:48.110
<i>Those glints will always create miracles because they never give up.</i>

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:51.840
<i>His stubbornness... is beating me down!</i>

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:55.160
Takamura!

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.570
<i>I can only see the bottom.</i>

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:07.730
<i>Son of a bitch! I can't even keep my body up!</i>

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.320
<i>A foot. Is he right in front of me?</i>

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.490
<i>You're coming with me!</i>

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:31.610
Both fighters go down!

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.000
A double knockdown!

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:43.220
He took him down with a lariat-like hook, 
just as he was about to fall!

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.140
Wow.

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:48.230
I've never seen a double knockdown before.

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:51.340
Get up, Takamura!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.520
Do it, and you'll win!

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:54.040
Get up, Takamura!

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.480
Stand up, Eagle!

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.220
Who'll be the first to get up?

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.530
Or will it be a double knockout?!

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:02.530
Takamura-san! Stand up!

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.250
Stand up!

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.470
Both boxers stand up at the same time!

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:17.050
Box!

00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.370
But they're on the verge of collapse!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.050
The champion still struggles forward!

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:25.270
There's something wrong with Takamura-san!

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:27.930
He can't see with his eyelid all swollen.

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:29.630
He's looking for Eagle.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:34.900
<i>Here I am, Takamura! I'm right here!</i>

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:37.730
The champion's one-twos push him against the ropes!

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:43.700
<i>Shit, so there you are.</i>

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:47.830
He hits back! The champion bucks backward!

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.790
This time it's the champion!

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:53.790
The challenger strikes back!

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:55.770
They duke it out!

00:09:55.770 --> 00:10:00.430
Will one of these be the final hit? Or will this continue all night?

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:01.820
He's weakening.

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:03.600
You're talking about Eagle?

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:04.550
No.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:07.560
Takamura isn't packing much of a punch.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:10.560
They're not as powerful or as keen as they once were.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:15.060
<i>If this slugfest keeps up, victory will be ours!</i>

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:19.030
Ah! The champion's legs give out on him!

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:20.820
What the devil?!

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:24.070
Why? Why is Eagle the one losing this slugfest?!

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:26.070
Takamura...

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:28.580
<i>I get it.</i>

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:30.040
<i>Now I get it.</i>

00:10:30.760 --> 00:10:35.360
<i>Now I know why a{yes “a”} Brian Hawk can be so crippled by fear.</i>

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:41.170
<i>Takamura's gloves aim straight for a man's vital areas.</i>

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:45.930
<i>Even if he can't see the other guy, he lands them... perfectly...</i>

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:48.930
<i>This is the result of the most brutal of training!</i>

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:52.900
<i>Shit... You're tough.</i>

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:56.190
<i>I wanted to see your face all the way to the end.</i>

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.600
<i>But I can only see your feet.</i>

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:00.730
<i>All I know is your general location.</i>

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.910
<i>I gotta do what I gotta do.</i>

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.950
<i>Just do...</i>

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:07.870
<i>what I was trained to do!</i>

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:13.870
He shouldn't be able to see much of anything. How is he hitting those vitals?

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:16.110
<i>I know that answer.</i>

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:19.010
<i>We've done it tens of thousands of times over.</i>

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:21.880
<i>We can hit those places even with our eyes closed.</i>

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:24.870
<i>We've developed those reflexes!</i>

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:27.680
<i>We know what's there even with our eyes closed.</i>

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.930
<i>Even with our eyes closed...</i>

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:35.440
<i>It's not just his animal instincts and nerves of steel.</i>

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.930
<i>They both lie on a foundation of endless training.</i>

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:42.400
<i>That is where his true strength and his true fearsomeness lie.</i>

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:44.900
<i>Now I really can't afford to lose!</i>

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:48.910
<i>Nobody has trained more than I have!</i>

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.410
<i>Takamura!</i>

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:55.000
<i>You are such an excellent opponent that I put everything on the mat!</i>

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:57.430
<i>I got what I wanted!</i>

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.920
<i>I'm satisfied!</i>

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:16.940
<i>Just do what I have to do.</i>

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:19.620
<i>Do what I was trained to do.</i>

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:25.110
<i>Take aim at the old man's mitts... and punch!</i>

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:39.620
<i>Where? Where the hell are you?!</i>

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:41.670
<i>There?</i>

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:44.670
<i>Punch them! Punch them! Punch them!</i>

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:39.180
That's a nice punch.

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:41.350
It's accurate and cuts to the core.

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:43.000
Old man?

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:47.360
Turn around and take a gander with those squinty eyes of yours!

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:58.100
We have a new champion!

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:19.930
Takamura! Takamura! Takamura!{ad infinitum}

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:03.040
Takamura Mamoru has now swept two weight classes!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:23.380
The winning punch was his left counter.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.560
It landed straight on the temple.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:29.150
And that son of a bitch did it blind.

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:31.650
Yeah!

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:46.630
<i>I let myself be too satisfied right at the bitter end.</i>

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.670
<i>But he never once gave up the fight.</i>

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:52.600
<i>That was what made him prevail...</i>

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:54.860
<i>No.</i>

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:56.490
<i>That's just an excuse.</i>

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:59.050
<i>He is simply the better boxer.</i>

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:04.060
I lost, Mamoru Takamura.

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.720
That was a good fight!

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.220
Come to Japan again!

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.070
You got yourself a new fan!

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:19.580
This was an invaluable experience!

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:22.080
Sure.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.580
Takamura-kun!

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:40.970
Up you go!

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.950
Hell yeah!

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:02.620
Yeah!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:06.180
Get down there.

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:08.230
Congratulate him for me too.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:09.170
I will!

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:16.070
<i>I guess I didn't need to worry.</i>

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:23.180
<i>Takamura-san may have lost his eyesight, but he never lost his aim!</i>

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:27.570
<i>He just aimed for the coach's mitts and hit them without fail!</i>

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:29.230
Takamura-san!

00:16:31.610 --> 00:16:34.280
<i>His tremendous faith in our coach,</i>

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:35.780
<i>and...</i>

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.780
<i>his endless training got him this win!</i>

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:41.770
Hurray, Takamura-san!

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:59.840
The reporters have left.

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:01.890
Not that I mind a little craziness.

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:05.310
But I'm not in the mood right now.

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:08.810
He was a powerful opponent.

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:16.960
I'm heading out. I need some sleep.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:20.320
Takamura-kun, your belts!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.740
These are important, you know!

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:25.280
Don't need ‘em.

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:31.970
They're yours, just like I promised!

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:34.040
Put ‘em under your pillow or something.

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:40.910
What?! These weren't easy to get!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.550
Aren't you thrilled?

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.770
I'll hold them while I sleep.

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:55.120
Later!

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:57.780
Good fighting!

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:12.210
Hurray!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:15.460
{simul}You got the world title!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:15.460
{simul}Congratulations!

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:16.710
Way to go!

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.050
Shut the hell up!

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:25.050
Aren't you gonna let me rest up, huh?!

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:27.250
Sorry! We're just so happy for you!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.120
Coach told us to accompany you.

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.070
You had a really hard fight.

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:36.480
We don't want anything to happen, so we're taking you home.

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:36.480
{One!}

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:41.350
Fine, whatever.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.280
That nincompoop.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:52.290
He knows damn well I'm thrilled.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:58.790
It's a true blessing when a trainer sees his boxer win the world title.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:04.270
I do feel blessed... but not as his trainer anymore.

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:13.350
To me, that guy's...

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:16.080
the greatest son I ever had!

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:29.030
All done!

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.080
What have you done?!

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:34.290
You look just like him!

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:35.330
In what way, dumbass?!

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:36.340
Can it!

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:40.530
Now it's your turn.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.670
Quit messing around! We didn't even lose!

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:47.800
But I said “If you didn't win.” You both tied!

00:19:47.800 --> 00:19:48.640
Idiot!

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:52.120
That hurt, you old fossil!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.390
I don't believe you...

00:19:54.640 --> 00:19:58.500
Can't you even act like a champion, you stupid bastard!

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:00.220
Ow! What're you doing?!

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.560
Why are you beating us too?!

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:02.630
Stay away from me!

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:04.150
Somebody take that cane away!

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:05.410
Ow!
